# App Router / UI

- Default to Server Components; add `"use client"` only when needed.
- Reuse `src/lib/supabase/server.ts` or `client.ts` — do not invent new Supabase client factories.
- After UI edits, follow `.cursor/skills/verify-frontend-change/SKILL.md` before calling the work done.
- For landing/visual work, also follow `.cursor/skills/ui-design/SKILL.md`.
- Clickable things must look clickable: links get colour + underline, and the pointer cursor for buttons/selects comes from the base layer in `globals.css` (Tailwind 4 does not add it) — do not re-add `cursor-pointer` per component.
- Form / CTA hierarchy: primary actions（追加・保存など）は塗りつぶしボタン見た目。secondary（キャンセルなど）は枠線ボタン。テキストリンクのままにしない（#6 L4 フィードバック）。ナビゲーション自体は `Link` のままでよいが、見た目はボタンに合わせる。
- Save buttons on create/edit forms: `type="button"` + `formRef.requestSubmit()` — not `type="submit"` — so Enter in a single-line field does not save（#33）。
- Destructive delete: `<form action>` + Server Action `redirect(..., "replace")` on success; avoid client `location.replace` after programmatic action calls（#26 L4）。
- Render user-visible timestamps with the JST helpers in `src/lib/recipes.ts`; the server runs in UTC.
